WEBVTT

00:00.020 --> 00:03.440
<b>Twin Demons</b>

00:13.990 --> 00:16.480
My dear children.

00:18.040 --> 00:20.750
You must now fight to the death.

00:21.750 --> 00:25.130
I shall make the winner my son.

00:32.720 --> 00:34.050
Older brother...

00:34.880 --> 00:37.640
I am mother's son.

00:38.400 --> 00:41.760
In the end, we are the children of demons.

00:49.940 --> 00:52.210
Well done.

00:53.150 --> 00:54.520
Mother...

00:57.200 --> 01:03.510
In our family, we have our twins fight 
to the death and eat the survivor.

01:03.510 --> 01:08.000
Then we attain eternal youth. 
That's the legend.

01:08.000 --> 01:12.250
Now, offer up your life to your mother.

01:15.310 --> 01:19.290
Mother, you tricked us, didn't you?

01:32.330 --> 01:34.000
Older brother,

01:34.000 --> 01:39.200
at this rate, both you and I will perish.

01:39.450 --> 01:40.920
Indeed.

01:41.540 --> 01:47.170
But if we turn our two lives into one...

02:03.520 --> 02:05.260
Older brother...

02:05.260 --> 02:07.010
Do not worry.

02:08.780 --> 02:11.610
I have stuffed and mounted Mother.

02:12.760 --> 02:15.430
Now we are all together.

02:18.280 --> 02:23.400
<i>That world I had always envisioned</i>

02:23.400 --> 02:27.050
<i>Could I have found it?</i>

02:35.920 --> 02:40.540
<i>I lived my days at someone 
else's convenience</i>

02:40.960 --> 02:45.170
<i>Gaining nothing but compromises and regrets</i>

02:45.170 --> 02:47.310
<i>Because I always felt that</i>

02:47.310 --> 02:51.200
<i>Even if it wasn't me standing here</i>

02:51.200 --> 02:55.240
<i>The world would still keep moving forward</i>

02:55.240 --> 02:59.040
<i>Even after I lost it</i>

02:59.040 --> 03:01.320
<i>And its colors faded</i>

03:01.320 --> 03:05.400
<i>The dream from that hazily remembered day</i>

03:05.400 --> 03:07.360
<i>Still remained</i>

03:07.360 --> 03:09.790
<i>The thing that only I can do</i>

03:09.790 --> 03:12.510
<i>And the scenery that I left behind</i>

03:12.510 --> 03:20.030
<i>I was just looking for an answer 
from some other time</i>

03:21.360 --> 03:26.220
<i>Those things that don't change</i>

03:26.220 --> 03:31.800
<i>And those words I protected so carefully</i>

03:31.800 --> 03:36.440
<i>Even if they're all just 
unattractive junk to others</i>

03:36.440 --> 03:44.840
<i>They're all treasures 
that I will never give up</i>

03:52.690 --> 03:55.250
Blast it! This magical energy!

03:55.520 --> 03:58.750
You took our dog, didn't you?!

03:58.750 --> 04:00.490
What are you talking about?

04:00.490 --> 04:02.480
It was my magical energy to begin with.

04:02.480 --> 04:04.470
Grandpa, are you all right?

04:07.690 --> 04:09.640
Eight Formations of the Fires of War!

04:10.260 --> 04:11.630
Flame Sword!

04:12.850 --> 04:15.810
Seventh Sword! Sixth Sword!

04:15.810 --> 04:18.020
We have magic too!

04:18.020 --> 04:20.410
Two mouths can speak incantations faster!

04:22.370 --> 04:25.560
Fifth Sword! Fourth Sword!

04:26.650 --> 04:29.700
Three are my fangs! Two are my arms!

04:30.700 --> 04:33.060
At the foot of the frozen peaks...

04:30.700 --> 04:33.060
stand eternal icicle flowers.

04:33.060 --> 04:35.610
In that garden where time has stopped,

04:33.060 --> 04:35.610
a form like that of a grave marker...

04:35.610 --> 04:36.530
Ice...

04:35.610 --> 04:36.530
...bound...

04:36.530 --> 04:37.420
...Gaol!

04:40.900 --> 04:43.590
Pierce through, Red Flames!

05:01.530 --> 05:04.560
An eight-pointed Flame Sword?

05:04.560 --> 05:06.960
How... How could a human have...

05:07.560 --> 05:09.130
You have been punished.

05:14.260 --> 05:15.580
Geezer...

05:15.580 --> 05:17.720
Morlock-san.

05:25.600 --> 05:30.960
Raelza, your... <i>our</i> old man is amazing!

05:32.860 --> 05:34.280
Father!

05:34.280 --> 05:35.950
Raelza...

05:37.050 --> 05:39.440
You're willing to call me "Father"?

05:39.440 --> 05:42.680
Are you playing around right now? 
Don't go growing ears like that!

05:44.980 --> 05:46.200
A tail?!

05:46.210 --> 05:49.170
So, after being an undead, now you're 
a beast-person, you rotten old geezer?

05:49.170 --> 05:51.080
This doesn't make any sense! Explain!

05:51.080 --> 05:53.000
I-I don't remember.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.000
I will bury you.

05:54.000 --> 05:56.700
He said the dog gave him his power back.

05:57.740 --> 05:58.720
Dog?

05:58.720 --> 06:00.570
Oh, right! That's right, woof!

06:00.570 --> 06:02.210
You said "woof" on purpose, didn't you?

06:02.650 --> 06:05.460
As parents, our feelings 
for our children were the same.

06:06.120 --> 06:09.590
This time, it's my turn to save him.

06:24.110 --> 06:25.220
Blast it.

06:25.220 --> 06:28.240
No matter how many I defeat, 
they just keep coming.

06:29.900 --> 06:32.400
Scorching heat, gather now.

06:32.400 --> 06:34.730
The vessel for the heart 
of an explosion stands here.

06:34.730 --> 06:38.300
O great flame serpents, 
gather here and dance

06:54.260 --> 06:58.560
Tier five magic... Flaming Whirlwind.

06:58.560 --> 07:01.060
I must hurry to my master's side.

07:01.520 --> 07:03.100
There are still some left?

07:03.440 --> 07:05.570
You blasted...

07:07.120 --> 07:09.740
Pemo, don't! Stay hidden!

07:10.650 --> 07:13.320
N-Not in a place like this...

07:13.320 --> 07:17.200
I am going to go to my master's side...

07:25.300 --> 07:26.920
Wait, you are...

07:29.130 --> 07:30.410
There are too many!

07:30.410 --> 07:32.010
Ninia, exorcise them!

07:32.010 --> 07:33.800
Open, sacred ark,

07:33.800 --> 07:37.600
and with white flames, 
send back these lives.

07:44.880 --> 07:47.260
And the priest girl as well.

07:47.260 --> 07:48.770
Will you both lend your aid?

07:54.530 --> 07:56.380
We'll charge you for it.

07:56.380 --> 07:58.320
You never say what you really mean, do you?

08:01.370 --> 08:03.180
Save the dog?

08:03.180 --> 08:05.360
Do you mean giving the magical energy back?

08:05.360 --> 08:07.750
But then, Grandpa, you'll...

08:07.750 --> 08:12.630
He gave the magical energy back 
so that I could defeat the demon.

08:17.290 --> 08:18.970
Oh, I see.

08:19.360 --> 08:23.460
You're telling me to look 
after the pup in exchange.

08:24.300 --> 08:25.760
I understand.

08:26.200 --> 08:30.070
After all, I love my own children very much.

08:30.730 --> 08:32.120
In that moment,

08:32.120 --> 08:34.920
his desire to save his 
own child was so strong

08:34.920 --> 08:38.400
that he gave me his own power as well.

08:38.400 --> 08:43.370
If we can return that portion 
and lift the curse he's under, then...

08:45.530 --> 08:49.340
I want to save him. We're both fathers.

08:53.310 --> 08:54.240
Morlock-san!

08:54.240 --> 08:55.640
Blast it!

08:56.650 --> 08:57.720
It hurts.

08:57.720 --> 08:59.340
I will not forgive.

08:59.660 --> 09:01.060
It really hurts.

09:01.060 --> 09:04.160
I will not forgive. I will not forgive you!

09:05.310 --> 09:06.500
It can't be!

09:06.500 --> 09:09.320
It can still move after being hit 
with tier eight magic?

09:09.320 --> 09:10.810
Morlock-san?

09:10.810 --> 09:12.660
What's wrong, geezer?

09:13.150 --> 09:16.720
Grandpa? How? You're not hurt?

09:16.720 --> 09:18.990
It should have pierced right through you!

09:21.440 --> 09:23.780
The magical energy, mine and the dog's,

09:23.780 --> 09:26.410
seems to be a dangerous combination.

09:26.720 --> 09:28.920
Power is welling up inside me.

09:29.920 --> 09:31.710
G-Geezer?

09:31.710 --> 09:33.040
Why do you look like that?

09:39.200 --> 09:41.960
It's almost as though 
I've regained my youth.

09:42.760 --> 09:44.060
Grandpa?

09:44.060 --> 09:45.870
Are you Morlock-san?

09:45.870 --> 09:48.030
Th-This is completely ridiculous!

09:48.030 --> 09:50.980
You mere human!

09:50.980 --> 09:55.480
So, you can survive tier eight magic 
that would burn even a dragon?

09:55.480 --> 09:57.690
Unforgivable!

09:57.690 --> 10:00.650
Unforgivable? That's what we're saying.

10:01.420 --> 10:02.780
You human!

10:02.780 --> 10:04.910
Don't get ahead of yourself!

10:04.910 --> 10:07.880
An upper-level demon, 
basically Demon King class...

10:07.880 --> 10:11.420
But I'm strong right now, you know?

10:13.700 --> 10:14.700
What is that?

10:14.700 --> 10:15.680
A golem?

10:22.240 --> 10:23.560
Is this...

10:23.560 --> 10:27.680
It's from when his teleportation 
magic misfired, and he fused with one!

10:27.680 --> 10:30.060
It's merely a doll!

10:31.680 --> 10:34.780
We don't want your magical energy anymore.

10:35.870 --> 10:37.870
We'll tear you limb from limb.

10:37.870 --> 10:39.030
Geezer!

10:47.360 --> 10:49.400
It's been a while since I've called it up,

10:49.400 --> 10:53.540
but since we fused together once, 
it moves exactly as I want it to.

10:56.900 --> 10:59.380
Stop your nonsense!

11:12.370 --> 11:13.690
It's still standing!

11:13.690 --> 11:15.230
Just how strong is it?

11:15.230 --> 11:18.070
You've forced us to 
take this fight seriously.

11:18.570 --> 11:20.070
So we shall show you!

11:22.000 --> 11:25.610
Our true form as demons!

11:27.630 --> 11:29.260
You're doing that now?

11:31.210 --> 11:34.200
You underestimate the adventurers 
of this realm too much.

11:36.460 --> 11:37.930
You can't move, can you?

11:37.930 --> 11:40.470
That's a barrier made 
from the fragments of the golem.

11:41.120 --> 11:44.690
I must show my appreciation 
for the way you've treated my family.

11:44.690 --> 11:47.020
I'll let you have 
something I've been saving.

11:48.730 --> 11:51.270
Distant light, act as guide,

11:51.270 --> 11:53.750
frolic in the soundless garden,

11:53.750 --> 11:55.810
and when the clash leaves us 
on the verge of collapse,

11:55.810 --> 11:57.520
split the depths of the earth...

11:57.520 --> 11:58.800
Descend now!

12:00.160 --> 12:01.960
That incantation...

12:01.960 --> 12:03.660
It can't be... Don't!

12:03.660 --> 12:07.030
If you use it at this distance, 
your allies will be caught up in it too!

12:07.840 --> 12:09.910
Is that what the barrier is for?

12:10.380 --> 12:12.710
Divide Heaven and Earth!

12:16.420 --> 12:19.300
Stardust gathers and becomes an iron hammer.

12:19.300 --> 12:21.000
A meteor?

12:41.860 --> 12:43.850
Don't be nervous, Saitou.

12:43.850 --> 12:46.860
The barrier will block the blast force,

12:46.860 --> 12:49.520
and disperse the force only vertically.

12:50.360 --> 12:53.450
Within the compressed heat and impact,

12:53.450 --> 12:55.520
no demon could remain unscathed.

12:56.060 --> 12:57.340
Morlock-san...

12:57.340 --> 12:58.420
Geezer.

12:58.420 --> 13:00.630
Grandpa, this power is...

13:01.640 --> 13:02.400
It isn't over yet!

13:03.000 --> 13:04.220
It's still alive!

13:04.220 --> 13:06.240
What incredible endurance.

13:06.240 --> 13:08.880
No, is it regenerating?

13:09.280 --> 13:11.080
Then, just one more push.

13:11.080 --> 13:13.540
All I need do is eliminate it completely...

13:13.540 --> 13:15.150
using the eight-pointed Flame Sword.

13:15.630 --> 13:17.600
Eight Formations of the Fires of War!

13:17.600 --> 13:18.800
Flame Sword.

13:20.950 --> 13:22.180
Geezer...

13:25.200 --> 13:26.890
I forgot the rest.

13:26.890 --> 13:27.700
What?

13:27.700 --> 13:30.430
What?!

13:31.410 --> 13:34.080
It's magic... something or other.

13:35.400 --> 13:37.080
Geezer, run!

13:37.080 --> 13:38.590
<i>The two with so much battle experience</i>

13:38.590 --> 13:41.380
<i>thought that Morlock-san 
would be invincible once he awakened,</i>

13:41.380 --> 13:43.120
<i>so their reactions were delayed.</i>

13:44.290 --> 13:46.350
<i>But as a handyman, I was different.</i>

13:47.300 --> 13:49.920
<i>Because I'm weak, I am always...</i>

13:51.110 --> 13:54.930
<i>looking for what I can do in the moment!</i>

13:57.350 --> 13:58.600
Saitou!

13:59.370 --> 14:01.330
Morlock-san, burn him!

14:01.330 --> 14:02.940
He'll regenerate!

14:03.330 --> 14:05.080
You really are something.

14:05.080 --> 14:07.920
<i>A dependable son is certainly worth having.</i>

14:08.450 --> 14:09.720
Here we go!

14:09.720 --> 14:12.950
Scorching heat, gather now! Cage...

14:13.260 --> 14:15.320
Um...

14:15.320 --> 14:16.330
Ablaze!

14:16.330 --> 14:19.320
Cage ablaze, fill now with spirit and will!

14:19.320 --> 14:21.080
Prisoner of flames,

14:21.080 --> 14:22.330
I release your binding chains!

14:27.300 --> 14:29.190
Did that finally finish it off?

14:29.190 --> 14:31.680
I don't sense the demon's magical energy.

14:31.680 --> 14:34.800
Saitou, you did well 
to jump in like that for me!

14:38.830 --> 14:40.680
It is you, Morlock-san.

14:40.680 --> 14:42.620
I thought you might suddenly 
turn into a skeleton,

14:42.620 --> 14:45.950
or forget your incantations, 
so I was paying close attention.

14:46.500 --> 14:49.740
And I've been training a little.

14:49.740 --> 14:52.200
I can swing a sword around.

14:52.630 --> 14:57.330
Of course, I can't fight 
like Raelza can, though.

14:58.500 --> 14:59.930
Saitou.

15:00.330 --> 15:01.290
Saitou!

15:34.310 --> 15:37.290
Fountain of air, gush forth and gather here.

15:37.290 --> 15:40.120
Become a blade that severs currents...

15:40.120 --> 15:41.120
It can't be!

15:41.120 --> 15:42.620
No! That blade is...

15:47.590 --> 15:50.750
This blasted pup!

15:52.600 --> 15:55.040
O-Our magical energy is drying up.

15:55.040 --> 15:57.560
Younger brother, answer me!

15:59.640 --> 16:02.500
S-So, he has perished.

16:02.500 --> 16:06.330
Here, in a place like this...

16:07.660 --> 16:08.960
He disappeared.

16:08.960 --> 16:10.770
Still, don't let down your guard.

16:10.770 --> 16:12.980
Grandpa, please give me some magical energy!

16:12.980 --> 16:15.170
I'll purify this whole area.

16:15.170 --> 16:16.580
O-Oh, of course.

16:17.160 --> 16:19.240
We'll help, too!

16:20.670 --> 16:23.950
Oh, it's the lovely elf and dear Ninia!

16:23.950 --> 16:26.030
Those ears. Is that you, Gramps?

16:26.030 --> 16:28.800
Master! I apologize for my tardiness!

16:28.800 --> 16:31.800
Um... Who are you?

16:45.380 --> 16:47.190
I'll go and check things out!

16:47.190 --> 16:51.290
So this was that light earlier? 
This is incredible.

16:51.290 --> 16:55.110
I'd expect no less from my master. 
I wish I could have seen it up close.

16:55.110 --> 16:58.010
I don't sense any evil 
magical energy here anymore.

16:58.580 --> 17:01.580
My dear Ninia...

17:02.440 --> 17:05.770
It's really over this time for sure, right?

17:05.770 --> 17:08.950
All we can do now is leave the rest 
to those who can use magic.

17:08.950 --> 17:10.330
And...

17:14.220 --> 17:17.720
It doesn't seem like 
the pup did that to save us.

17:23.930 --> 17:27.060
<b>You killed my father! 
I will make you pay too!</b>

17:30.700 --> 17:31.820
Geezer?

17:45.120 --> 17:47.750
<b>Curses, why does a human...</b>

17:47.750 --> 17:50.500
<b>smell like my dad...</b>

17:56.510 --> 17:58.050
I'll give it back.

17:58.710 --> 18:02.360
The demon dog was cursed by its master,

18:02.360 --> 18:04.880
so it wasn't able to absorb magions 
from the air anymore.

18:05.400 --> 18:07.280
Once the curse is broken,

18:07.280 --> 18:11.890
and I give this power back, 
it should be able to live in this realm.

18:11.890 --> 18:13.640
How do you know that?

18:13.640 --> 18:16.120
When I received this magical energy,

18:16.120 --> 18:18.660
I touched upon the dog's memories.

18:20.220 --> 18:23.280
My magic is greater than that of the demons.

18:23.280 --> 18:24.910
I can break the curse.

18:24.910 --> 18:26.160
Wait!

18:26.490 --> 18:29.780
If you give that power back, 
what will happen to you?

18:29.780 --> 18:31.200
I don't know.

18:31.520 --> 18:34.430
It's only a portion, but I am
 giving some magical energy back.

18:34.430 --> 18:38.680
I might go back to being a skeleton, 
and if things go badly...

18:38.680 --> 18:40.380
Then why do that for some dog?

18:40.380 --> 18:41.880
Some dog?

18:43.600 --> 18:46.070
Is that how you truly feel?

18:49.790 --> 18:53.960
Every day, I go adventuring 
with my three children.

18:53.960 --> 18:58.560
I understand how a parent feels 
about their children.

19:00.580 --> 19:05.400
Saitou, that discussion we had about 
if the worst happened...

19:05.400 --> 19:08.030
about my daughter, Raelza...

19:08.030 --> 19:09.450
You know what to do, don't you?

19:09.450 --> 19:12.250
What? What are you saying?

19:12.250 --> 19:14.470
Morlock-san, it's almost like...

19:14.470 --> 19:17.960
It's only in the worst case. 
Who do you think I am?

19:17.960 --> 19:20.840
I'm the number one magician 
in the great labyrinth, you know?

19:20.840 --> 19:23.220
I'll show you that 
I can save one little dog.

19:26.950 --> 19:28.430
Hey, ravenous wolf...

19:28.750 --> 19:33.010
My children have been able to 
stand on their own for a long time now.

19:33.010 --> 19:37.610
But your boy still needs you.

19:38.850 --> 19:43.440
I will send magical energy until the 
thread of your life is spun firmly once more.

19:44.330 --> 19:49.710
And if my own life is spent in the process, 
then I shall live on within you.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.040
Grandpa?

19:52.040 --> 19:52.960
Master!

19:52.960 --> 19:54.400
Geezer!

19:54.400 --> 19:56.010
Morlock-san...

20:10.760 --> 20:13.290
<i>Where am I?</i>

20:15.480 --> 20:16.620
<i>Am I...</i>

20:24.330 --> 20:25.570
<i>I see.</i>

20:26.220 --> 20:29.250
<i>So, I can join you at last.</i>

20:32.700 --> 20:34.080
<i>No, you can't.</i>

20:34.080 --> 20:36.380
<i>You can't come here yet.</i>

20:36.990 --> 20:38.200
That's right.

20:38.470 --> 20:41.330
You still have things 
you need to do, don't you?

20:41.330 --> 20:42.150
<i>Dad!</i>

20:43.930 --> 20:46.120
<i>Dad! Dad!</i>

21:00.360 --> 21:04.360
<i>Dad, don't leave me.</i>

21:07.120 --> 21:09.870
<i>I won't. We'll always be together.</i>

21:10.360 --> 21:11.870
I'm happy for you.

21:12.630 --> 21:16.380
The curse is broken. You're free.

21:16.880 --> 21:18.730
<i>The two-legged warrior...</i>

21:19.370 --> 21:22.000
Make sure you live well, 
for the geezer's sake, too.

21:35.120 --> 21:37.670
<i>I swear to repay this 
debt of gratitude one day.</i>

21:38.140 --> 21:42.310
<i>If ever my strength is needed, 
call upon me at any time.</i>

21:42.310 --> 21:44.560
Don't come near town anymore.

21:45.020 --> 21:46.900
We won't meet again.

22:29.950 --> 22:32.750
<i>Like being gently carried away on a current</i>

22:32.750 --> 22:35.410
<i>Like drifting off to sleep at night</i>

22:35.410 --> 22:37.660
<i>Like there's nothing 
particularly special about it</i>

22:37.660 --> 22:39.640
<i>Our hearts are one</i>

22:39.640 --> 22:42.480
<i>"See you later" illuminates the way</i>

22:42.480 --> 22:44.490
<i>To the depths of the future</i>

22:44.490 --> 22:49.370
<i>Where kindness is the one 
thing I'm certain I felt</i>

22:49.370 --> 22:54.350
<i>You know, I'm sure we 
don't know anything</i>

22:54.350 --> 22:59.300
<i>But you know, for right now, that’s fine</i>

22:59.300 --> 23:01.980
<i>I'm waiting, I'm waiting</i>

23:01.980 --> 23:04.140
<i>Let's sing here again</i>

23:04.140 --> 23:06.930
<i>One day, we'll shine the light</i>

23:06.930 --> 23:09.610
<i>Now, I think I can embrace even my tears</i>

23:09.610 --> 23:11.720
<i>As we picture it, as we paint it</i>

23:11.720 --> 23:13.860
<i>A single bit of warmth is all there is</i>

23:13.860 --> 23:20.420
<i>And now, so that we can 
laugh, let's hold hands</i>

23:20.420 --> 23:26.280
